    "created_at": "2023-06-14T21:35:23Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-06-14T22:07:56Z",
    "body": "We, at least, definitely want to update (in fact, we [already did](https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/pull/14716)). The definition of this encoding has been updated upstream. There needs to be a consistent behavior between the web browser on a platform and native apps on the platform. As the adage goes, \"the future is longer than the past\" and there will be more content produced with the new mappings than there is existing content. We can't just close our eyes and hope that all authors use UTF-8, especially when there are laws requiring that ~all products sold in certain places must conform.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
